### File request mau. Mo bang VS Code + extension "REST Client" roi bam "Send Request".
### Luu y: gio API CO PHAN QUYEN. Hay chay request "Dang nhmap" truoc de lay token,
### REST Client se tu nho token qua bien {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### ====================== XAC THUC ======================

### Dang ky tai khoan moi (role CUSTOMER) - tra ve luon token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "secret123",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "fullName": "Nguoi Dung Moi"
}

### Dang nhap ADMIN (dat ten @login de cac request sau dung token nay)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

### Dang nhap CUSTOMER
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "customer", "password": "customer123" }

### Thong tin tai khoan dang dang nhap
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Xin access token moi tu refresh token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}" }

### ====================== SAN PHAM ======================

### Danh sach san pham (CONG KHAI - khong can token), co phan trang + sap xep
GET {{host}}/api/products?page=0&size=5&sort=price,desc

### Loc san pham theo ten + khoang gia + danh muc
GET {{host}}/api/products?search=iphone&minPrice=1000000&maxPrice=30000000&categoryId=1

### Chi tiet 1 san pham (cong khai)
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### Tao san pham moi (CAN STAFF/ADMIN)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "iPad Air",
  "description": "May tinh bang Apple",
  "price": 16990000,
  "stockQuantity": 30,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Tao san pham bang token CUSTOMER -> 403 Forbidden (de kiem chung phan quyen)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Hang cam", "price": 1000, "stockQuantity": 1, "categoryId": 1 }

### Cap nhat san pham (STAFF/ADMIN)
PUT {{host}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "name": "iPhone 15 Pro",
  "description": "Ban nang cap",
  "price": 28990000,
  "stockQuantity": 45,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Xoa MEM san pham (STAFF/ADMIN) - sau do GET danh sach se khong con thay no
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/4
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ====================== DON HANG ======================

### CUSTOMER tao don cho CHINH MINH (khong gui customerId)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 },
    { "productId": 4, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### ADMIN/STAFF dat ho khach khac (duoc phep gui customerId)
POST {{host}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{
  "customerId": 2,
  "items": [ { "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Danh sach don (CUSTOMER chi thay don cua minh; STAFF/ADMIN thay tat ca)
GET {{host}}/api/orders?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Doi trang thai don hang (CHI STAFF/ADMIN)
PATCH {{host}}/api/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{ "status": "PAID" }

### ====================== BAO CAO (CHI STAFF/ADMIN) ======================

### San pham ban chay nhat
GET {{host}}/api/reports/best-sellers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Doanh thu theo ngay
GET {{host}}/api/reports/daily-revenue
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Tong doanh thu
GET {{host}}/api/reports/total-revenue
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ====================== QUAN TRI USER (CHI ADMIN) ======================

### Danh sach user (phan trang)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Gan lai vai tro cho user id=3
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/users/3/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

["CUSTOMER", "STAFF"]

### Khoa tai khoan user id=3
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/users/3/enabled?enabled=false
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Nhat ky dang nhap (ADMIN)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/login-events?size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ====================== DANH MUC ======================

### Danh sach danh muc (public)
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Tao danh muc (STAFF/ADMIN)
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Phu kien" }

### ====================== GIO HANG ======================

### Them vao gio (CUSTOMER)
POST {{host}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{ "productId": 4, "quantity": 2 }

### Xem gio
GET {{host}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Dat hang tu gio (checkout)
POST {{host}}/api/cart/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ====================== DANH GIA ======================

### Gui danh gia (can dang nhap)
POST {{host}}/api/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{ "rating": 5, "comment": "San pham tot" }

### Diem trung binh (public)
GET {{host}}/api/products/1/reviews/summary

### ====================== TAI KHOAN / THANH TOAN ======================

### Doi mat khau
POST {{host}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

{ "oldPassword": "customer123", "newPassword": "newpass123" }

### Thanh toan don (mock) -> PAID
POST {{host}}/api/orders/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### ====================== BAO CAO MO RONG ======================

### Doanh thu theo danh muc
GET {{host}}/api/reports/revenue-by-category
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Doanh thu theo thang
GET {{host}}/api/reports/revenue-by-month
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Top khach hang
GET {{host}}/api/reports/top-customers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Xuat CSV ban chay
GET {{host}}/api/reports/best-sellers/csv
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
